[{"client_msg_id":"f5953886-489b-4205-8855-62ac1782839a","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"これで迷うことなくなった :kan: :sha:","ts":"1617001299.151900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4Q2hk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0e8834a4-c072-4d35-9b93-96465b943f22","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"冷静に考えたら `l:\u0026amp;{option}` だと辞書 `l:` にアクセスすることになるからおかしいか","ts":"1617001282.151500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/SRLl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3f7b3446-f8a1-4c35-9021-42e436a2dd95","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"そしてヘルパビリティ（？）がとても低い（`:h expr-option` が正解）","ts":"1617000595.150100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":4,"users":["U7B4ZD49X","UL6CFN8NR","U01BY3SDBRS","U017BU3UZBQ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7iZX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"71a31317-93c9-4bba-8d90-df89c3bd3831","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"その書き方めっちゃ便利なんですけど毎回 `\u0026amp;l:{option}` と `l:\u0026amp;{option}` のどっちだった分からなくなってヘルプ引いてます・・","ts":"1617000559.149500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["UAZ33BKV2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bEyF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4c8e54d8-cc42-49eb-bf0b-c89a256699cb","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"いろいろ弄る系プラグインで \u0026amp;l: でローカルな値を一時退避させてたりはありますねえ...","ts":"1616999546.148500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EE9ZY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"45d9f4dd-1ece-46cc-bbe6-2eba57384ff2","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"早速、fern バッファだけ statusline をウワがいてみたが動いてるっぽいです。","ts":"1616999310.147800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oallc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8a39a4af-9d